1
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:02,240
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,510
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:04,780
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,050
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,450
Te sammukha.

6
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:09,250
May the spawns of asuras perish

7
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,920
by the hands of my sacred masters.

8
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,210
These nine enchanted rounds

9
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,690
took much to craft,

10
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,130
as you may have witnessed.

11
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,230
Mind how you spend them.

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,500
I am not the only soul

13
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:24,600
to assist you.

14
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,800
He deem me his mother,

15
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,310
and himself my son.

16
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,880
Thong.

17
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,310
Where is your mommy?

18
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:11,010
You smell good.

19
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:34,210
I'm good at doing laundry.

20
00:01:44,070 --> 00:01:45,700
I shall lend you a hand

21
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,700
so that it may be finished with haste...

22
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,510
for I may

23
00:01:54,530 --> 00:01:57,000
linger with you
all the longer this morn

24
00:01:57,610 --> 00:01:59,290
before you betake yourself to work.

25
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,510
You can be sweet

26
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,600
and affectionate, I see.

27
00:02:09,610 --> 00:02:11,700
I kinda want you

28
00:02:12,010 --> 00:02:14,090
to have periods more often

29
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,480
if you're gonna be
this cute and affectionate.

30
00:02:18,610 --> 00:02:19,890
You do go on.

31
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,390
I'm kidding.

32
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,680
Who'd want you to be in pain?

33
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:33,450
There are many sides of me
yet to be discovered, my dearest.

34
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:36,510
Should you linger with me
until that very day,

35
00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:39,410
you shall behold

36
00:02:39,990 --> 00:02:41,200
all of me.

37
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:48,700
Let's see.

38
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,320
Do you really want me to discover it?

39
00:02:50,510 --> 00:02:51,600
Can I see?

40
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:57,810
I told you afore

41
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,600
that I shall never halt you.

42
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,480
Hm...

43
00:03:02,610 --> 00:03:04,190
Do you mean it?

44
00:03:04,390 --> 00:03:05,200
Let's see.

45
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,930
Let me prove that

46
00:03:06,950 --> 00:03:08,510
you really won't stop me.

47
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:19,020
I'll stay here with you

48
00:03:19,690 --> 00:03:20,790
for a long, long time.

49
00:03:24,510 --> 00:03:26,000
You promised?

50
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:29,900
Since we've already

51
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:32,900
made a mess on the bedsheets...

52
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:34,520
should we...

53
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:39,310
pick up where we left off?

54
00:03:40,410 --> 00:03:42,500
Never once have I halted you, my dearest.

55
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:44,590
Really?

56
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,750
As I said afore,

57
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:18,200
I shall do the laundry myself.

58
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,000
It's okay.

59
00:04:22,210 --> 00:04:23,820
I'm happy to do it for you.

60
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:24,720
Hey,

61
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:26,590
I may not look it,

62
00:04:26,610 --> 00:04:29,040
but I'm really good at doing laundry.

63
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:30,020
Look at this.

64
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,000
Here,

65
00:04:32,410 --> 00:04:33,680
the stains

66
00:04:33,710 --> 00:04:34,810
are nowhere to be found.

67
00:04:44,970 --> 00:04:45,900
I thank you

68
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,010
for not being aghast.

69
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,650
Of course.

70
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:56,410
What is that lovely smell?

71
00:05:02,530 --> 00:05:03,700
Is it from here?

72
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,010
Let's see...mmm.

73
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,310
Ow!

74
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:10,700
Blushing?

75
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:13,900
It is infused with flowers.

76
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,890
I mingle flowers
already offered to the sacred masters

77
00:05:16,910 --> 00:05:18,330
with scented water,

78
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:20,720
dry them, and use them
to scent my garments.

79
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:22,820
No wonder

80
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:26,490
every time I get close to you,

81
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,360
I can smell...

82
00:05:29,090 --> 00:05:30,510
something so heavenly.

83
00:05:31,420 --> 00:05:32,330
Turns out,

84
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:33,610
it's...

85
00:05:34,110 --> 00:05:35,680
the smell of flowers.

86
00:05:37,990 --> 00:05:38,690
Come on,

87
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:40,310
let me put it to the test.

88
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:43,620
Ow!

89
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:45,100
My beloved!

90
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,520
Do you find it pleasing?

91
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:49,850
If so,

92
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:53,010
I shall turn them
into a potpourri for you to cherish.

93
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:55,310
Whenever the scent greets you,

94
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:58,810
you shall dream of me
by your side without end.

95
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:01,110
Thanks.

96
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:02,300
Well...

97
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:04,090
that sounds good.

98
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:07,530
When I go out and about,

99
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:08,780
it's gonna feel like...

100
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:11,660
you're with me at all times.

101
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,040
Is this it?

102
00:06:22,710 --> 00:06:23,710
Smells good.

103
00:06:26,610 --> 00:06:27,720
It smells exactly like you.

104
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:28,920
But...

105
00:06:29,790 --> 00:06:30,590
this...

106
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:31,840
smells better.

107
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:45,620
Ow...

108
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,190
Who are you?

109
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,770
Do you not remember me?

110
00:07:42,790 --> 00:07:44,010
Bulan.

111
00:07:57,890 --> 00:07:59,100
Is everything alright?

112
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:03,990
It is, indeed.

113
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,560
Go inside, my dearest.

114
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,660
Jeez,

115
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,920
it took me an hour
to hang them out to dry.

116
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:14,400
It's too damn windy, my beloved.

117
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,600
There goes your dearest's masterpiece.

118
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,090
My dearest,

119
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,120
let us go inside.

120
00:08:22,220 --> 00:08:22,970
Sure.

121
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:27,000
Let's go, my beloved.

122
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:02,080
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

123
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:06,750
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

124
00:09:06,770 --> 00:09:11,080
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

125
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:15,400
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

126
00:09:15,420 --> 00:09:19,830
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

127
00:09:19,850 --> 00:09:24,350
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

128
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:28,460
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

129
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:33,030
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

130
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:38,160
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

131
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,610
I'm Lom,

132
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:16,000
Master's chief disciple.

133
00:10:22,990 --> 00:10:24,340
How fortunate that

134
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:27,020
the ceremony is being held
on a day when the sanctum is closed.

135
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,510
This way, I wouldn't have
to babysit the sanctum

136
00:10:29,530 --> 00:10:31,490
when you and Ms. Ladfah

137
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:32,730
go make merit together.

138
00:10:34,810 --> 00:10:36,540
And where is Ladfah?

139
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,410
Why has she allowed
you here all alone, dear Lom?

140
00:10:39,210 --> 00:10:41,190
Ugh, my mom?

141
00:10:41,210 --> 00:10:42,420
It hurts just talking about it.

142
00:10:42,730 --> 00:10:44,840
Mom told me
she'd meet me at your sanctum,

143
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:46,740
but she ended up bailing.

144
00:10:47,110 --> 00:10:47,940
Here,

145
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,990
she asked me to make merit on her behalf.

146
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:53,200
At what point can one
make merit on behalf of another?

147
00:10:54,570 --> 00:10:55,370
It can be done.

148
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:58,550
She already wired the money!

149
00:10:58,570 --> 00:11:00,820
Look, I've bought
so many things for merit-making.

150
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,320
There's more

151
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:03,540
in the car.

152
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,330
Boom!

153
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:07,480
I'm planning to make tons of merit,

154
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,000
so maybe I'll be blessed enough

155
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:10,810
to finally be taken.

156
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:12,080
I'm so fed up with

157
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,540
being single,

158
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,490
lonely,

159
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,610
and forlorn.

160
00:11:18,490 --> 00:11:20,720
How many times have I told you afore

161
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:22,550
that you shall find your mate

162
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:24,290
when the time is ripe?

163
00:11:24,550 --> 00:11:26,050
Before then,

164
00:11:26,070 --> 00:11:28,600
your paths shall always miss,
never to cross.

165
00:11:28,770 --> 00:11:30,210
Alright,

166
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,890
I know.

167
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:33,300
But...

168
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,480
people's lives

169
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:36,080
are driven by love.

170
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:38,430
Without it,

171
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:41,720
you have no strength to eat,

172
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:43,110
walk,

173
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:44,620
or sleep.

174
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:48,230
There's no strength to do anything!

175
00:11:48,610 --> 00:11:49,610
By the way...

176
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:53,580
you look so healthy,

177
00:11:53,870 --> 00:11:54,980
with...

178
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,800
glowing skin.

179
00:11:58,220 --> 00:12:00,900
Anything that's been keeping you satisfied?

180
00:12:02,690 --> 00:12:04,000
Your mouth

181
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,920
is, indeed, as big as ever.

182
00:12:06,990 --> 00:12:08,130
Whoa...

183
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:10,210
I was just teasing you.

184
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:11,750
You're just...

185
00:12:11,770 --> 00:12:13,100
so brutal.

186
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,520
By the way,

187
00:12:18,310 --> 00:12:19,720
who is she?

188
00:12:20,050 --> 00:12:20,970
Where is she from?

189
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:31,800
I'm asking you, Master.

190
00:12:32,570 --> 00:12:33,510
Where...

191
00:12:34,610 --> 00:12:35,970
are you from?

192
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:41,810
I'm...

193
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:44,880
in a little bit of trouble,

194
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:45,990
so...

195
00:12:46,770 --> 00:12:49,710
I'm staying with Master
for the time being.

196
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,190
I too am Master's disciple.

197
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:57,570
Typically...

198
00:12:58,010 --> 00:13:01,590
Master wouldn't just
let any disciple stay at her sanctum.

199
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:03,960
I don't think that's the case.

200
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:06,400
Disparate deeds, disparate occasions.

201
00:13:06,710 --> 00:13:08,530
I deem it appropriate that she stays,

202
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:09,680
so I let her.

203
00:13:10,950 --> 00:13:13,040
Then, could I please spend the night here?

204
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:16,080
I miss Thong,

205
00:13:16,530 --> 00:13:18,020
and I wanna gossip

206
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:18,920
in case...

207
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:22,040
I've...missed something somewhere.

208
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:23,790
Could I, dear Master?

209
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:25,500
How could you not?

210
00:13:25,850 --> 00:13:27,730
You too are my disciple, dear Lom.

211
00:13:29,010 --> 00:13:29,790
Do spend the night here.

212
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,000
Do not waste your money on a hotel room.

213
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:34,000
I shall ready you a chamber.

214
00:13:40,810 --> 00:13:41,880
Then...

215
00:13:42,490 --> 00:13:44,990
I'd better get going to work.

216
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:46,130
I'm already running late.

217
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:50,980
Heading out.

218
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,200
Dear Lom.

219
00:13:58,530 --> 00:13:59,090
Yes?

220
00:13:59,110 --> 00:14:01,170
Mind your limits when you trifle.

221
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:02,510
Keep chaos at bay,

222
00:14:02,890 --> 00:14:05,130
or they might say
you do not know any better.

223
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:06,190
Oops...

224
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:09,110
I was just being playful.

225
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:11,330
You're being way too harsh.

226
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:13,910
I just...

227
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:16,100
wanna know

228
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:18,590
what your karmic soulmate

229
00:14:19,290 --> 00:14:20,210
is like.

230
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:24,590
Well...

231
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:27,000
how do you see her?

232
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:30,640
Are we of one mind?

233
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:32,900
Mm...

234
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:34,790
So...

235
00:14:36,530 --> 00:14:37,720
Does she know

236
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:42,020
what awaits her

237
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,120
as your karmic soulmate?

238
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:52,010
I traveled into town
to make a few purchases

239
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,760
for almsgiving at the grand ceremony;

240
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,400
thus, I am paying you
a visit, Venerable Mother.

241
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:57,020
Is there anything you desire?

242
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,710
I shall make a purchase for you.

243
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,720
I am well.

244
00:15:01,740 --> 00:15:03,410
I am in need of nothing.

245
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:09,610
Dear Lom is still as lively as ever.

246
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,080
Let's see.

247
00:15:12,780 --> 00:15:14,290
You're such a cutie!

248
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:16,410
She has bloomed into womanhood

249
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,210
but still behaves like a child.

250
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:21,700
You too, my beautiful daughter.

251
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:23,790
There is still

252
00:15:23,810 --> 00:15:25,000
a childlike glimmer in your eyes,

253
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:27,820
and your radiant face

254
00:15:28,150 --> 00:15:29,720
makes you look younger than thirty.

255
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,220
I suppose

256
00:15:32,670 --> 00:15:34,810
you are in love, my beautiful daughter.

257
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:39,410
I wonder if you are content,

258
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:42,110
both your beautiful self

259
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:44,680
and the karmic soulmate
whom you have just found.

260
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:50,400
It is indeed what you
and Father have taught me.

261
00:15:51,610 --> 00:15:52,700
In sorrow,

262
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,410
it is agony.

263
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:56,000
In happiness,

264
00:15:56,270 --> 00:15:57,700
it is euphoria.

265
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:01,810
Life is not nearly
as simple as it once was,

266
00:16:02,590 --> 00:16:04,320
but I yearn not for the past.

267
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:08,020
Were there to be
any hurdles along the way,

268
00:16:08,620 --> 00:16:10,800
I wish to triumph over them with her.

269
00:16:13,210 --> 00:16:14,910
Had your father been alive,

270
00:16:15,790 --> 00:16:18,210
he would have
slapped his knee with delight.

271
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:28,400
So what is the reason...

272
00:16:28,710 --> 00:16:31,400
for that sorrowful look
on your visage, my beautiful daughter?

273
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:33,880
Should something be on your mind,

274
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,310
pray tell,

275
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:37,600
so that your burden may be eased.

276
00:16:41,370 --> 00:16:44,320
Have you heard a word of him?

277
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:49,190
Ever since he left
the late master's sanctum,

278
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:51,300
barely

279
00:16:51,830 --> 00:16:53,740
a whisper about him has reached my ears.

280
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,110
I bore him,

281
00:16:57,710 --> 00:16:59,500
but his frame is his own,

282
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:01,620
and so is his mind.

283
00:17:02,310 --> 00:17:04,310
I could not halt him.

284
00:17:05,810 --> 00:17:08,070
My beautiful daughter,
you inquired of him.

285
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:10,310
Do you have anything on your mind?

286
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:15,390
I dreamed of him, Mother.

287
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,200
I am worried

288
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:19,600
that he might do evil.

289
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:22,820
Mother...

290
00:17:23,090 --> 00:17:24,590
About the sorcerous tiger,

291
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:27,340
know you my heart well enough to believe

292
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:29,150
that I never mused to usurp it?

293
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,710
The sorcerous tiger

294
00:17:34,770 --> 00:17:37,610
is not to be bequeathed to any soul.

295
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,890
The late master
must have bequeathed it to you

296
00:17:40,910 --> 00:17:43,200
for a sensible reason.

297
00:17:44,250 --> 00:17:45,890
It is your duty

298
00:17:46,410 --> 00:17:48,310
to hallow it.

299
00:17:50,470 --> 00:17:51,490
My beautiful daughter,

300
00:17:51,730 --> 00:17:53,700
worry not.

301
00:17:58,110 --> 00:18:00,110
Beyond all else,

302
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:02,010
whatever shall happen

303
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,800
shall happen.

304
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,600
I trust that

305
00:18:08,130 --> 00:18:09,900
your virtues

306
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:12,130
will shield her

307
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:14,290
from any harm.

308
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:23,220
Even when I ought
to commit heinous karma,

309
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,200
I shall protect her.

310
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:31,650
[Phop Phra Police Station]

311
00:18:31,670 --> 00:18:33,510
Do you know why I called you in?

312
00:18:35,290 --> 00:18:37,600
It's about Sergeant Piak and me

313
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:40,140
trespassing on private property

314
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:42,270
to capture a suspect, sir.

315
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,480
And what else?

316
00:18:46,850 --> 00:18:49,020
About Sergeant Piak and me

317
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:50,420
operating across districts

318
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,520
without permission, sir.

319
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:54,590
So you realize all that.

320
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,730
And why did you still proceed?

321
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,410
Or is someone backing you up?

322
00:19:01,770 --> 00:19:03,700
Sarge, since you've been here a long time,

323
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:06,120
I trusted you with
taking care of Lieutenant Peem.

324
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:07,300
And what is this?

325
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,600
What kind of senior are you?

326
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:11,890
Why didn't you stop her?

327
00:19:12,710 --> 00:19:14,380
I am sorry, Chief.

328
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:16,250
I'll take disciplinary action
against you, Sarge.

329
00:19:16,690 --> 00:19:18,820
It is not his fault, sir.

330
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,240
He was just following my orders.

331
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:24,440
If you're taking disciplinary action,

332
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,780
you should take it against me,

333
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,990
not him.

334
00:19:28,290 --> 00:19:29,800
Do you want to be a hero?

335
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:32,510
Don't think I won't punish you

336
00:19:32,910 --> 00:19:33,780
out of respect for your parents.

337
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:36,220
I'm not here to be anyone's hero.

338
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:38,510
I'm here

339
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:41,490
to fulfill my duty as a police officer,

340
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:43,150
which is to pursue and capture criminals,

341
00:19:43,170 --> 00:19:44,560
even outside our jurisdiction.

342
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:48,450
And if my intention to capture a criminal

343
00:19:48,470 --> 00:19:50,710
means disobeying your orders, Chief,

344
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,890
I'll accept
whatever punishment you give me.

345
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,880
Keep up that cockiness.

346
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:00,810
Please don't!

347
00:20:02,670 --> 00:20:03,800
I'm begging you!

348
00:20:04,430 --> 00:20:05,900
Can we talk this out calmly?

349
00:20:06,450 --> 00:20:07,490
Do whatever you want.

350
00:20:07,510 --> 00:20:08,440
You can even punish me

351
00:20:08,610 --> 00:20:09,710
or cut my salary.

352
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:11,090
I'll accept whatever comes my way!

353
00:20:16,750 --> 00:20:17,510
If you're so capable,

354
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:19,710
close this case.

355
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,040
What are you saying, sir?

356
00:20:23,890 --> 00:20:26,620
I'm saying
I'm officially assigning you two

357
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,810
to work on this case.

358
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:33,410
Go, deploy to the area fast

359
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:36,730
and monitor the Krua Tan Procession.

360
00:20:37,110 --> 00:20:38,110
Understood, sir!

361
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:39,610
Yes, sir.

362
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:56,800
Sarge,

363
00:20:58,130 --> 00:20:59,480
what are they doing?

364
00:21:00,190 --> 00:21:01,000
Oh.

365
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,600
Those are baskets called "Guay."

366
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:05,390
It's Da day, a preparation day.

367
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:07,210
It's the day before the merit-making event,

368
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,700
so the villagers are weaving Guay baskets

369
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,050
to put the offerings in.

370
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,460
It's just...

371
00:21:12,990 --> 00:21:15,520
Simply put, they're like
woven bamboo baskets for offerings to monks.

372
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:17,100
Mm...

373
00:21:17,390 --> 00:21:19,400
Yeah, and tomorrow
is the Krua Tan Procession.

374
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:20,800
There's a lottery called "Salak Bhat,"

375
00:21:20,820 --> 00:21:21,750
where a monk calls you

376
00:21:21,770 --> 00:21:24,490
to make an offering if your lot is drawn.

377
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:28,920
So it's like
a New Year's lucky draw, Sarge?

378
00:21:29,490 --> 00:21:30,570
Something like that.

379
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:34,500
It's merit-making
without targeting a specific monk,

380
00:21:34,810 --> 00:21:36,380
so you gain immense merit in return.

381
00:21:37,100 --> 00:21:37,810
Lieutenant,

382
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,010
are you interested?

383
00:21:40,710 --> 00:21:41,980
Let's not, Sarge.

384
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,100
I don't think

385
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:44,600
it's appropriate to play around

386
00:21:44,620 --> 00:21:46,160
while we're on patrol.

387
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,500
Please do it, Lieutenant.

388
00:21:47,890 --> 00:21:49,910
We just encountered
something evil the other day.

389
00:21:51,210 --> 00:21:51,840
Let's go.

390
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:54,300
Come on.

391
00:21:54,700 --> 00:21:55,570
Is it a good idea, Sarge?

392
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:56,710
Of course.

393
00:21:56,730 --> 00:21:58,290
How is making merit not a good idea?

394
00:22:00,020 --> 00:22:01,300
But I've never done this, Sarge.

395
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:02,320
Neither have I.

396
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:14,360
Legend has it that

397
00:22:14,930 --> 00:22:17,420
if a daughter of a household
pounds chilli paste loudly,

398
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:20,560
she is ready for marriage.

399
00:22:20,830 --> 00:22:21,500
Ugh!

400
00:22:22,210 --> 00:22:24,180
I couldn't be more ready.

401
00:22:24,750 --> 00:22:26,770
When will I get to marry, Master?

402
00:22:28,300 --> 00:22:30,010
I told you afore not to be in haste.

403
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:33,000
Soon enough, you shall find them.

404
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,610
Wow...

405
00:22:34,630 --> 00:22:36,390
If you already know this much,

406
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,120
just spill already.

407
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:39,710
Ugh.

408
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:41,500
Next year, I'll turn 25,

409
00:22:41,530 --> 00:22:42,800
the ominous age.

410
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:46,110
I'll probably have bad luck
every other day.

411
00:22:46,130 --> 00:22:47,020
Dear Lom,

412
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:49,620
the bird-of-paradise yantra
I inked on you,

413
00:22:49,790 --> 00:22:52,590
apart from turning every word
you utter into wealth and fortune,

414
00:22:52,710 --> 00:22:55,920
shall also make your words
come true, as though you were a prophet.

415
00:22:56,910 --> 00:22:58,600
Thus, should you speak of goodness,

416
00:22:58,810 --> 00:23:00,590
good things shall come to you,

417
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,400
but should you speak thoughtlessly,

418
00:23:02,600 --> 00:23:05,110
bad things shall also come your way.

419
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:18,380
Hey...

420
00:23:18,740 --> 00:23:20,190
are you two cooking?

421
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:24,000
We are preparing supper
for the almshouse tomorrow.

422
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:26,130
What have you brought
in your hands, my dearest?

423
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,400
Little Guay baskets.

424
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:32,040
I wove them myself

425
00:23:32,060 --> 00:23:33,410
so we can go make merit

426
00:23:34,090 --> 00:23:35,640
at the temple tomorrow.

427
00:23:43,370 --> 00:23:45,030
Well, well.

428
00:23:45,490 --> 00:23:47,240
Are you two making merit by yourselves?

429
00:23:48,290 --> 00:23:50,280
I'm here, too.

430
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:53,320
I don't see a Guay basket
you wove for me.

431
00:23:54,120 --> 00:23:55,120
How inconsiderate.

432
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:56,280
Dear Lom.

433
00:23:56,740 --> 00:23:57,550
Oops...

434
00:23:57,890 --> 00:23:58,890
I was just...

435
00:23:59,610 --> 00:24:01,020
joking.

436
00:24:02,210 --> 00:24:03,710
Whoever you intended to give it to...

437
00:24:04,570 --> 00:24:06,050
let it be so, Officer.

438
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,490
Fine work for your first endeavor.

439
00:24:09,710 --> 00:24:12,020
I shall treasure tomorrow's alms

440
00:24:12,040 --> 00:24:14,040
in this little Guay basket you made.

441
00:24:16,860 --> 00:24:18,030
It's beautiful, isn't it?

442
00:24:22,690 --> 00:24:23,890
And...

443
00:24:24,210 --> 00:24:25,720
is there anything I can help you with?

444
00:24:58,110 --> 00:24:58,900
Here.

445
00:25:00,830 --> 00:25:01,620
Did you...

446
00:25:02,590 --> 00:25:03,800
weave it for me?

447
00:25:05,470 --> 00:25:07,500
Wow!

448
00:25:12,410 --> 00:25:15,050
I'm not that inconsiderate.

449
00:25:15,670 --> 00:25:16,490
Just take it.

450
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,170
Now, you have...

451
00:25:18,310 --> 00:25:21,110
something to carry your stuff
when we go make merit tomorrow.

452
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:26,320
You're a good person at heart.

453
00:25:27,310 --> 00:25:28,800
No wonder

454
00:25:29,230 --> 00:25:31,600
you're Master's karmic soulmate.

455
00:25:34,820 --> 00:25:35,670
Look,

456
00:25:35,690 --> 00:25:37,390
I worked so hard on it.

457
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:39,520
Isn't it neat?

458
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:43,210
A red birthmark!

459
00:25:46,300 --> 00:25:48,500
If you place your hand next to Master's,

460
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:50,090
they'll form...

461
00:25:50,230 --> 00:25:51,680
a perfect heart?

462
00:25:53,700 --> 00:25:54,480
Mm.

463
00:25:54,850 --> 00:25:56,300
Whoa...

464
00:26:10,040 --> 00:26:10,720
Lom,

465
00:26:12,190 --> 00:26:14,380
can I ask you something?

466
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,160
Mm.

467
00:26:15,810 --> 00:26:18,500
The term "karmic soulmate,"

468
00:26:19,700 --> 00:26:21,060
what does it mean?

469
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,820
"Karmic soulmates"

470
00:26:29,990 --> 00:26:33,100
are two souls bound
by the merits of past lives

471
00:26:35,010 --> 00:26:37,400
and destined to meet each other,

472
00:26:38,210 --> 00:26:39,300
love each other,

473
00:26:40,020 --> 00:26:40,800
and...

474
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:43,710
enhance each other's virtues.

475
00:26:45,700 --> 00:26:46,620
Look,

476
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,140
your existence

477
00:26:48,260 --> 00:26:52,600
makes Master
a woman of boundless might and virtue.

478
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:56,920
But...

479
00:26:56,940 --> 00:26:58,510
on the other hand,

480
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:02,600
Master's weakness

481
00:27:02,650 --> 00:27:04,620
has started to take shape.

482
00:27:07,780 --> 00:27:09,210
But don't you worry.

483
00:27:10,450 --> 00:27:12,220
Master will protect you.

484
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,760
She's not gonna let any harm come to you.

485
00:27:16,100 --> 00:27:18,310
I'm not worried about myself.

486
00:27:18,330 --> 00:27:20,320
I'm worried about her.

487
00:27:20,610 --> 00:27:23,010
I also wanna shield her...

488
00:27:23,290 --> 00:27:25,480
from any harm.

489
00:27:25,980 --> 00:27:26,560
So...

490
00:27:27,740 --> 00:27:29,480
what are you waiting for?!

491
00:27:29,840 --> 00:27:32,010
Why haven't you asked
my master to be your girlfriend?

492
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:40,360
Well...

493
00:27:40,800 --> 00:27:41,800
I...

494
00:27:42,130 --> 00:27:43,620
don't know how to explain this,

495
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:45,840
but our relationship...

496
00:27:46,120 --> 00:27:48,070
is rather complicated.

497
00:27:48,100 --> 00:27:49,550
Besides,

498
00:27:49,570 --> 00:27:51,320
I don't even know if...

499
00:27:51,540 --> 00:27:53,680
this Master of yours

500
00:27:53,790 --> 00:27:56,120
feels the same way I do.

501
00:28:00,940 --> 00:28:02,900
Before all this,

502
00:28:03,710 --> 00:28:05,210
a wealthy person

503
00:28:05,500 --> 00:28:07,180
brought cash

504
00:28:07,610 --> 00:28:09,280
and land title deeds

505
00:28:09,900 --> 00:28:11,510
to ask for her hand in marriage.

506
00:28:12,310 --> 00:28:13,790
But she

507
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,590
reject it all,

508
00:28:16,930 --> 00:28:18,250
saying,

509
00:28:18,270 --> 00:28:20,810
"I shall only linger
for my karmic soulmate,"

510
00:28:22,220 --> 00:28:24,060
which is you!

511
00:28:24,650 --> 00:28:27,880
If you want to define your relationship,

512
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,690
you have to do something.

513
00:28:34,300 --> 00:28:35,300
Go ahead.

514
00:28:41,900 --> 00:28:43,120
How do you mean, dear Lom?

515
00:28:43,890 --> 00:28:46,290
I've been in an ambiguous relationship.

516
00:28:47,390 --> 00:28:49,590
Without a clear label,

517
00:28:50,900 --> 00:28:53,550
the other person
could get confused, Master.

518
00:28:58,620 --> 00:29:00,440
And do my actions

519
00:29:00,470 --> 00:29:02,600
not speak plainly enough, then?

520
00:29:06,410 --> 00:29:08,850
Are actions alone cutting it these days?

521
00:29:09,290 --> 00:29:11,450
Words also matter.

522
00:29:12,190 --> 00:29:14,530
If you don't wanna lose the lieutenant,

523
00:29:15,980 --> 00:29:19,620
you have to give her some clarity, Master.

524
00:29:28,620 --> 00:29:29,620
Then...

525
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,160
off I go.

526
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:45,120
Want to sit?

527
00:30:00,900 --> 00:30:01,680
Hey.

528
00:30:05,710 --> 00:30:06,990
You're still awake, right?

529
00:30:23,220 --> 00:30:23,920
Hey...

530
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,200
It's just that...

531
00:30:34,900 --> 00:30:36,390
I...

532
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:39,310
I mean...

533
00:30:40,900 --> 00:30:42,120
I...

534
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:44,610
I wanna say that...

535
00:30:46,740 --> 00:30:47,410
That...

536
00:30:47,800 --> 00:30:50,180
- I...
- Do say what you wish to.

537
00:30:51,900 --> 00:30:53,180
I'm just gonna say...

538
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:58,200
Good night.

539
00:30:59,180 --> 00:30:59,890
Sweet dreams

540
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,410
tonight.

541
00:31:26,900 --> 00:31:27,590
Thong,

542
00:31:28,300 --> 00:31:29,600
your mom is not killing it.

543
00:31:31,350 --> 00:31:32,880
A full 100 points deducted.

544
00:31:59,350 --> 00:32:00,400
What say you

545
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:02,420
of the attire I sewed for you?

546
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:03,500
Is it not a thing of beauty?

547
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:07,800
It is...

548
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:11,210
No,

549
00:32:11,230 --> 00:32:12,230
I should say...

550
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:15,110
How ethereal, Master.

551
00:32:23,060 --> 00:32:24,600
You meant...

552
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:28,210
the attire I sewed for you, did you not?

553
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:34,720
Come,

554
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:36,610
I shall dress you in perfume.

555
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:16,320
It's morning. Let's go to the temple!

556
00:33:20,100 --> 00:33:20,740
Ooh...

557
00:33:22,850 --> 00:33:25,880
Whoa... Wow!

558
00:33:26,730 --> 00:33:28,240
What a beauty.

559
00:33:31,520 --> 00:33:32,680
Then...

560
00:33:32,700 --> 00:33:33,880
I will...

561
00:33:34,820 --> 00:33:36,200
wait for you guys downstairs.

562
00:33:45,410 --> 00:33:46,520
Master.

563
00:33:46,910 --> 00:33:49,380
I bought so many desserts.

564
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:51,810
Let's go enjoy them downstairs.

565
00:33:56,500 --> 00:33:57,600
Off I go now.

566
00:34:11,370 --> 00:34:12,580
Thank you.

567
00:35:14,670 --> 00:35:16,870
Can I write my little brother's name

568
00:35:16,890 --> 00:35:18,690
on the paper as well?

569
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:23,750
[Pichapat Ruechakun]

570
00:35:24,210 --> 00:35:25,210
Certainly,

571
00:35:26,050 --> 00:35:28,590
though you have to specify

572
00:35:28,610 --> 00:35:29,890
that the merits shall be dedicated

573
00:35:29,910 --> 00:35:31,870
to the recovery of the wounded,

574
00:35:32,180 --> 00:35:34,120
for if you merely write down the name,

575
00:35:34,220 --> 00:35:36,190
the monks will chant
a prayer for the deceased,

576
00:35:36,510 --> 00:35:37,760
which is bad luck.

577
00:35:38,430 --> 00:35:39,810
Ah...

578
00:35:40,290 --> 00:35:41,620
I just learned something new.

579
00:35:41,640 --> 00:35:42,730
So,

580
00:35:42,750 --> 00:35:44,480
what am I supposed to write down?

581
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:56,520
[Pichapat Ruechakun,
and alms on behalf of]

582
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:06,510
Then, you may write your brother's name

583
00:36:07,100 --> 00:36:08,680
after this word.

584
00:36:13,140 --> 00:36:14,140
Right here?

585
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:24,130
[Phuvaphatch Ruechakun]

586
00:36:27,710 --> 00:36:28,600
All done.

587
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:34,820
Let us go inside.

588
00:36:38,610 --> 00:36:40,850
- Dear Lom, follow along.
- Alright.

589
00:36:42,120 --> 00:36:43,310
Hello, Mom?

590
00:36:44,230 --> 00:36:46,710
Pray tell, the name
you would have me write down,

591
00:36:46,730 --> 00:36:47,670
Ms. Ladfah.

592
00:36:47,690 --> 00:36:49,690
Your name, Miss Tinee.

593
00:36:49,710 --> 00:36:52,930
A little bird told me that
your life's been sucking lately, no?

594
00:36:53,860 --> 00:36:55,410
Who's that little bird?

595
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,650
Which one of my friends?

596
00:36:56,670 --> 00:36:58,210
I will be sure to deal with them.

597
00:36:58,230 --> 00:37:00,060
Don't mess with my informants.

598
00:37:00,080 --> 00:37:01,700
Miss Tinee, I am serious.

599
00:37:01,720 --> 00:37:03,000
Alright, alright.

600
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:06,110
[Ms. Natinee Tangjareon]

601
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:09,200
Ooh, it's okay.

602
00:37:13,670 --> 00:37:14,620
Where is it?

603
00:37:15,710 --> 00:37:16,960
Thank you.

604
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,000
Thank you.

605
00:37:29,900 --> 00:37:30,900
Alright, Mom.

606
00:37:31,300 --> 00:37:33,010
I'm gonna hurry and make merit now.

607
00:37:35,900 --> 00:37:36,900
Thank you.

608
00:37:38,200 --> 00:37:39,310
My folks

609
00:37:39,330 --> 00:37:42,210
and all devoted laypeople,

610
00:37:43,290 --> 00:37:45,450
the venerable masters
and the monastic assembly,

611
00:37:46,010 --> 00:37:47,780
and all novice monks

612
00:37:47,950 --> 00:37:49,630
from every temple in the district

613
00:37:49,660 --> 00:37:51,730
have now taken their seats
at the Salak Bhat tables

614
00:37:51,750 --> 00:37:54,030
around the ordination hall.

615
00:37:54,050 --> 00:37:55,510
Next up,

616
00:37:55,540 --> 00:37:57,110
my folks,

617
00:37:57,300 --> 00:37:59,150
please check your ticket numbers.

618
00:37:59,900 --> 00:38:00,780
The venerable sirs

619
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:03,230
will have the novice monks

620
00:38:03,250 --> 00:38:05,660
call out the names to find
the owners of the strips of paper.

621
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:08,230
If you hear your name,

622
00:38:08,240 --> 00:38:10,500
or the name of the relative
you wish to dedicate it to,

623
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:13,180
please bring the alms in your Guay basket

624
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:15,700
to the venerable sirs.

625
00:38:18,410 --> 00:38:20,080
Dear Lom, are you
departing for home already?

626
00:38:20,700 --> 00:38:23,131
I have to drive to Chiang Rai

627
00:38:23,156 --> 00:38:24,960
to return the car to Ms. Ladfah
before flying to Bangkok.

628
00:38:25,140 --> 00:38:27,530
Pray, keep well, dear Lom.

629
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:29,830
Dwell in the present.

630
00:38:29,850 --> 00:38:31,810
Think not too much of the future.

631
00:38:32,810 --> 00:38:34,270
As for your mate,

632
00:38:34,290 --> 00:38:35,590
make no haste to find one.

633
00:38:36,110 --> 00:38:37,900
Your soulmate was already born.

634
00:38:38,630 --> 00:38:41,080
Soon enough, you shall meet them
without endeavor.

635
00:38:43,490 --> 00:38:47,080
Like how you met yours, right?

636
00:38:49,690 --> 00:38:50,300
Ow!

637
00:38:51,060 --> 00:38:53,130
Dwell not on my affairs.

638
00:38:58,580 --> 00:39:00,500
Next year,
you shall reach an age ending in 5,

639
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:02,490
which is not good.

640
00:39:03,210 --> 00:39:05,110
Should any peril arise,

641
00:39:05,130 --> 00:39:06,520
make haste to pay me a visit.

642
00:39:06,540 --> 00:39:07,380
Do you understand?

643
00:39:08,860 --> 00:39:10,130
Sure thing.

644
00:39:10,150 --> 00:39:11,320
If anything happens,

645
00:39:11,340 --> 00:39:13,170
I'll come see you as soon as possible.

646
00:39:14,060 --> 00:39:15,710
But it'd be better

647
00:39:16,250 --> 00:39:17,880
if we met at a merit-making ceremony

648
00:39:17,910 --> 00:39:18,910
or...

649
00:39:19,710 --> 00:39:21,950
a grand, auspicious ceremony.

650
00:39:29,610 --> 00:39:32,080
Well then, I'll be going.

651
00:39:33,190 --> 00:39:34,730
Have a safe journey.

652
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:36,680
Goodbye.

653
00:39:57,500 --> 00:39:59,090
Let Master sniff your head once

654
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:01,320
for good fortune.

655
00:40:02,810 --> 00:40:04,820
All done, Ms. Ladfah.

656
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:06,530
I am on my way to you.

657
00:40:07,910 --> 00:40:10,800
I'm so hungry! Emphasis on "so."

658
00:40:11,200 --> 00:40:14,890
I wanna eat
Ms. Ladfah's chicken khao soi.

659
00:40:15,620 --> 00:40:17,090
Don't try to sweet-talk me.
[Ms. Ladfah (Mom)]

660
00:40:17,520 --> 00:40:19,390
You only come home once in a while,

661
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,620
so whatever you want to eat,

662
00:40:20,640 --> 00:40:22,030
I got you, Miss Tinee.

663
00:40:28,010 --> 00:40:28,820
Argh!

664
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:31,750
Lom, what happened?!

665
00:40:34,210 --> 00:40:34,990
I...

666
00:40:36,080 --> 00:40:37,880
I... I think I....

667
00:40:38,020 --> 00:40:39,900
I think I ran over something.

668
00:40:40,210 --> 00:40:41,530
I'm hanging up.

669
00:40:54,600 --> 00:40:55,380
A cat!

670
00:40:57,020 --> 00:40:57,770
Help!

671
00:40:57,790 --> 00:40:58,880
Please help the cat!

672
00:40:58,910 --> 00:41:00,500
- Ma'am...
- Hand it over.

673
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:02,930
You can let go.

674
00:41:17,020 --> 00:41:18,270
Doctor,

675
00:41:18,290 --> 00:41:19,450
how's the cat?

676
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:21,810
Right now,
the cat has lost a lot of blood,

677
00:41:21,820 --> 00:41:24,000
but our clinic
doesn't have any blood on hand.

678
00:41:24,020 --> 00:41:25,820
I'll make some calls
and see if I can find some.

679
00:41:27,610 --> 00:41:28,610
Doctor...

680
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:31,920
Mom...

681
00:41:33,040 --> 00:41:34,600
I didn't mean to.

682
00:41:36,010 --> 00:41:39,290
I accidentally
ran over a kitten in the temple.

683
00:41:41,020 --> 00:41:43,200
Calm down, Lom.
Get a hold of yourself.

684
00:41:44,100 --> 00:41:46,590
It might not be
as bad as you think, sweetheart.

685
00:41:46,810 --> 00:41:48,770
I'll call the owner
of the place across the road.

686
00:41:48,790 --> 00:41:50,920
It's also a veterinary clinic.

687
00:41:51,290 --> 00:41:54,390
I heard they're running
some errands in Tak.

688
00:41:54,410 --> 00:41:56,300
They could probably help, sweetheart.

689
00:41:58,200 --> 00:41:59,010
Alright, Mom.

690
00:42:11,200 --> 00:42:12,620
Hey, Prasitthichok,

691
00:42:12,640 --> 00:42:13,710
is that your mama?

692
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:15,910
- Is she?
- Priew!

693
00:42:15,930 --> 00:42:17,990
- Whoa, hey, staring at my face...
- Hey, I think...

694
00:42:18,010 --> 00:42:20,310
- Hey, calm down, Prasitthichok.
- That balloon dart vendor is into me!

695
00:42:20,330 --> 00:42:22,480
- Calm down.
- You know, I only won one plush,

696
00:42:22,500 --> 00:42:24,830
but they gave me
one, two, three of them!

697
00:42:25,900 --> 00:42:27,080
- Hey!
- What do you think?

698
00:42:27,900 --> 00:42:29,390
Are you taken, girl?

699
00:42:29,470 --> 00:42:31,480
- I'm the sexist.
- Just go.

700
00:42:31,580 --> 00:42:32,430
You're out.

701
00:42:34,100 --> 00:42:35,600
Hello, Dad.

702
00:42:35,610 --> 00:42:36,770
You look like your dad...

703
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:40,900
Who the hell appeared in your dreams

704
00:42:41,180 --> 00:42:42,160
and told you to dress like that?

705
00:42:42,350 --> 00:42:43,480
This is Prada.

706
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,000
This is also Loewe.

707
00:42:45,100 --> 00:42:45,790
Haven't heard of them.

708
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:48,250
Look at how you're dressed.

709
00:42:48,820 --> 00:42:50,010
Don't your parents teach you anything?

710
00:42:50,030 --> 00:42:50,970
Oh, my gosh.

711
00:42:51,600 --> 00:42:52,840
- Brutal.
- Oh, my gosh.

712
00:42:53,080 --> 00:42:53,800
Priew,

713
00:42:54,260 --> 00:42:56,320
what pets...do you have here?

714
00:42:56,460 --> 00:42:57,470
- What, Dad? These are...
- What pets?

715
00:42:57,480 --> 00:42:59,210
My friends. They're my friends.

716
00:42:59,230 --> 00:42:59,990
Yeah.

717
00:43:00,010 --> 00:43:00,660
Yeah.

718
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:02,210
This one looks like an ancient frog.

719
00:43:03,780 --> 00:43:05,310
What the hell is that haircut?

720
00:43:05,720 --> 00:43:07,000
I thought you were a damn watercock.

721
00:43:07,710 --> 00:43:08,890
Ever seen a watercock?

722
00:43:09,600 --> 00:43:11,770
You kids...dress properly.

723
00:43:11,790 --> 00:43:12,680
Got it?

724
00:43:13,510 --> 00:43:14,200
Dad,

725
00:43:15,080 --> 00:43:16,310
how about this?

726
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:19,450
Don't worry at all.

727
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:20,590
As for Priew,

728
00:43:21,190 --> 00:43:22,410
I will...

729
00:43:23,120 --> 00:43:25,420
take care...of her.

730
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:28,280
Take care of yourself first.

731
00:43:29,720 --> 00:43:30,720
Go eat some food,

732
00:43:30,870 --> 00:43:32,480
something nutritious, maybe veggies.

733
00:43:33,300 --> 00:43:34,440
Then go take a big shit.

734
00:43:35,050 --> 00:43:36,400
Go back to your spot.

735
00:43:36,640 --> 00:43:38,340
Ugh, why are you giving her a hard time?

736
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:40,300
I don't even know
how to cuss you brats out anymore.

737
00:43:40,940 --> 00:43:42,600
And why did you
mod your motorcycle, huh?!

738
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:44,590
- Sarge.
- Is yours discolored?

739
00:43:44,610 --> 00:43:45,680
- Yes?
- No way.

740
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:51,000
Lieutenant,
have you been changing for long?

741
00:43:51,630 --> 00:43:53,370
Just now.

742
00:43:55,420 --> 00:43:56,420
Why did you change?

743
00:43:56,620 --> 00:43:57,520
You looked beautiful.

744
00:43:58,020 --> 00:43:59,100
"Beautiful," my butt.

745
00:43:59,120 --> 00:44:01,180
That outfit wasn't appropriate for work.

746
00:44:07,410 --> 00:44:08,090
Right,

747
00:44:08,350 --> 00:44:10,700
there's a stall
that sells watermelon juice.

748
00:44:11,310 --> 00:44:12,310
It's cold and refreshing.

749
00:44:12,330 --> 00:44:13,790
I'll take you there. It's my go-to spot.

750
00:44:14,100 --> 00:44:14,670
Wanna come with?

751
00:44:14,690 --> 00:44:16,180
- Sure, Sarge.
- Come on.

752
00:44:19,970 --> 00:44:21,380
Have fun, Daddy.

753
00:44:21,420 --> 00:44:23,800
- Can I come with?
- Ugh! Where the hell are you going, Stephan?!

754
00:44:32,420 --> 00:44:33,080
Lieutenant.

755
00:44:34,100 --> 00:44:34,730
Lieutenant.

756
00:44:36,440 --> 00:44:37,310
Lieutenant!

757
00:44:37,490 --> 00:44:38,600
What, Sarge?

758
00:44:38,910 --> 00:44:40,100
You scared me.

759
00:44:42,460 --> 00:44:44,110
You were staring without even blinking.

760
00:44:45,290 --> 00:44:47,300
What do you mean, "staring"?

761
00:44:47,520 --> 00:44:49,100
I didn't even do anything.

762
00:44:50,490 --> 00:44:51,610
Tubtim

763
00:44:52,510 --> 00:44:53,960
is full to the brim with charm.

764
00:44:54,410 --> 00:44:55,330
Right up my alley.

765
00:44:55,350 --> 00:44:56,380
Real mommy milkers.

766
00:44:56,630 --> 00:44:58,030
What an eyeful.

767
00:44:58,170 --> 00:45:00,790
Jeez, goodness me, I'm dead.

768
00:45:02,320 --> 00:45:03,910
There is no woman...

769
00:45:05,000 --> 00:45:07,200
more ethereal than Master Bulan.

770
00:45:08,010 --> 00:45:08,790
Exactly.

771
00:45:09,150 --> 00:45:10,200
No one's as fierce

772
00:45:10,220 --> 00:45:11,420
as Master Bulan.

773
00:45:12,900 --> 00:45:14,090
Careful, or you'll spill it.

774
00:45:17,290 --> 00:45:18,610
Here you go,

775
00:45:18,630 --> 00:45:19,880
your sweetest,

776
00:45:19,900 --> 00:45:21,270
juiciest,

777
00:45:21,290 --> 00:45:23,060
most refreshing watermelon smoothies.

778
00:45:23,470 --> 00:45:24,290
Aha.

779
00:45:24,310 --> 00:45:24,950
Aha.

780
00:45:25,110 --> 00:45:26,050
Here you go.

781
00:45:26,070 --> 00:45:26,860
Wow.

782
00:45:26,880 --> 00:45:28,140
That'd be 100 baht.

783
00:45:28,240 --> 00:45:29,540
Watermelons are pricey these days.

784
00:45:29,560 --> 00:45:30,710
Wanna help the local farmers?

785
00:45:30,910 --> 00:45:31,890
Thank you.

786
00:45:31,910 --> 00:45:32,670
Alright.

787
00:45:33,400 --> 00:45:34,170
Mm-hm.

788
00:45:35,510 --> 00:45:37,090
- Wow...
- I'm heading out, Sarge.

789
00:45:38,540 --> 00:45:39,050
Eek!

790
00:45:40,690 --> 00:45:41,690
Watermelon, please.

791
00:45:42,100 --> 00:45:43,100
Okay.

792
00:45:43,210 --> 00:45:43,760
One for me, please.

793
00:45:57,000 --> 00:45:57,840
How much?

794
00:46:03,620 --> 00:46:05,300
However much you wish, my dearest.

795
00:46:22,320 --> 00:46:23,320
Smells good...

796
00:46:24,390 --> 00:46:25,320
But...

797
00:46:25,790 --> 00:46:28,310
not as heavenly
as your flower-infused scent.

798
00:46:31,890 --> 00:46:33,410
Beautiful,

799
00:46:35,440 --> 00:46:38,830
but not as ethereal as you are, Master.

800
00:46:42,050 --> 00:46:43,810
You are uttering words
like those of a drunk.

801
00:46:44,230 --> 00:46:47,320
I suppose Sergeant Piak
has taken you to drink liquor.

802
00:46:49,300 --> 00:46:51,120
What liquor, Master?

803
00:46:51,400 --> 00:46:52,980
I'm on duty.

804
00:46:53,440 --> 00:46:55,010
I just took her

805
00:46:55,030 --> 00:46:57,200
to get Tubtim's watermelon smoothie.

806
00:46:59,300 --> 00:47:00,710
Oh... Oh, wow.

807
00:47:04,080 --> 00:47:05,220
We...

808
00:47:05,240 --> 00:47:06,700
We stood in line for so long,

809
00:47:07,510 --> 00:47:08,890
and you drank it pretty fast.

810
00:47:08,950 --> 00:47:10,240
Stop it, Sarge...

811
00:47:11,950 --> 00:47:12,520
Master,

812
00:47:12,810 --> 00:47:15,510
I took Lieutenant Peem to Tubtim's stall

813
00:47:15,540 --> 00:47:16,770
for some watermelon smoothies.

814
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:17,590
Wow...

815
00:47:17,610 --> 00:47:18,340
Boom.

816
00:47:18,360 --> 00:47:19,200
Kaboom.

817
00:47:20,380 --> 00:47:21,360
Real mommy milkers.

818
00:47:22,700 --> 00:47:23,260
It's not...

819
00:47:23,270 --> 00:47:25,580
It's not what he made it out
to be, Master.

820
00:47:26,300 --> 00:47:27,310
Don't be shy, Lieutenant.

821
00:47:28,120 --> 00:47:29,780
You can get the Great Charm yantra

822
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:31,640
from the Master to go after Tubtim.

823
00:47:34,400 --> 00:47:35,830
I didn't...

824
00:47:36,170 --> 00:47:37,650
do anything, Master.

825
00:47:37,670 --> 00:47:39,840
I was just looking at the yantra

826
00:47:39,860 --> 00:47:41,480
you tattooed on her...

827
00:47:42,020 --> 00:47:43,960
I just thought it was beautiful.

828
00:47:44,400 --> 00:47:45,680
I didn't mean to look

829
00:47:45,690 --> 00:47:47,920
at her breasts or anything.

830
00:47:50,670 --> 00:47:51,450
Jeez...

831
00:47:52,080 --> 00:47:53,180
You don't have to lie, Lieutenant.

832
00:47:53,560 --> 00:47:54,990
It's not good to lie in front of her.

833
00:47:55,700 --> 00:47:57,290
I saw how pleased you looked.

834
00:48:00,590 --> 00:48:02,400
I suppose the lieutenant

835
00:48:03,060 --> 00:48:04,980
is parched for watermelon juice

836
00:48:05,000 --> 00:48:08,020
from Tubtim's big, sweet watermelons.

837
00:48:08,140 --> 00:48:08,810
She is.

838
00:48:09,240 --> 00:48:10,190
Absolutely, she is.

839
00:48:16,810 --> 00:48:17,680
Paying your respects to the Buddha images?

840
00:48:17,700 --> 00:48:18,880
Take my place, for I am weary.

841
00:48:18,890 --> 00:48:19,480
What?

842
00:48:21,820 --> 00:48:22,540
You!

843
00:48:22,550 --> 00:48:23,700
You really enjoy ruining

844
00:48:23,720 --> 00:48:25,440
other people's relationships, don't you?

845
00:48:26,260 --> 00:48:28,190
- What?
- Keep your mouth shut, Sarge.

846
00:48:29,190 --> 00:48:30,090
Are you coming in?

847
00:48:30,110 --> 00:48:31,400
If not, throw that away for me.

848
00:48:31,590 --> 00:48:32,320
What?

849
00:48:32,480 --> 00:48:33,800
I was just teasing.

850
00:48:33,990 --> 00:48:34,990
Why the mood?

851
00:48:46,820 --> 00:48:48,420
All done, Auntie.

852
00:48:49,010 --> 00:48:51,210
